  "Tally is Locked": "Tally 已鎖定",
  "Tally is built only with Apple frameworks: SwiftUI, SwiftData, Swift Charts, LocalAuthentication, CryptoKit and Security. No third-party code is included in the app.": "Tally 僅使用 Apple 框架構建：SwiftUI、SwiftData、Swift Charts、LocalAuthentication、CryptoKit 和 Security。App 中不含第三方代碼。",
  "Tally keeps all data on this iPhone. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you export it or choose to download exchange rates.": "Tally 的所有資料都保存在這台 iPhone 上。除非你匯出資料或主動下載匯率，否則不會發送任何內容。",
  "Tally records balance adjustments, deletions, imports and restores so changes to your money can be traced.": "Tally 會記錄餘額調整、刪除、匯入和恢復，讓資金變動可以追溯。",
  "Tally tracks it in real time and lets you know gently when you get close.": "Tally 會實時追蹤，並在接近額度時溫和提醒。",
  "Tap + to record your first expense or income.": "輕點 + 記錄第一筆支出或收入。",
